Question 3: Advanced Dictionary — Employee Payroll System

Problem: Created an employee payroll system using nested dictionaries, Perform the following operations:

- Loops through all employees and calculates net salary (deduct 500 per absent day if attendance < 22 days)
- Uses conditions to categorize employees into salary bands: <20000 = "Junior", 20000-50000 = "Mid", >50000 = "Senior"
- Finds the department with the highest average salary by grouping employees using a new dictionary built with loops
- Implements pop(), update(), and del to handle: transfer (change department), fire (remove employee), and promote (update salary)
- Prints a final payslip dictionary for each employee with keys: name, gross, deductions, net, band


