Question 5: Advanced OOPs — Fix & Extend the Hospital Management System
Instructions: Below is a Hospital Management System written by a junior developer. It has 8 errors (syntax, logical, OOP-related). Your task:

1. Find and fix all 8 errors (mark each with a comment explaining what was wrong)
2. Add the requested functionality as per the tasks mentioned below

After fixing all errors, ADD the following functionality:
Task 1: Add a method discharge_patient(self, patient_name) in Hospital class that removes a patient by name from self.__patients. If not found, print "Patient not found".

Task 2: Add a method get_doctor_report(self, doctor_name) in Hospital class that returns a dictionary:
```
{"name": "Dr. Sharma", "specialization": "Cardiology", "patients_count": 1, "available_days": {"Monday", "Thursday"}}
If doctor not found, print "Doctor not found".
```
Task 3: Add a method calculate_discount(self) in Patient class — if get_total_bill() > 20000, return 10% discount amount, else return 0.

Task 4: Add a method show_cabin(self) in Doctor class that prints: "Dr. Sharma - Floor: 2, Room: 5" using tuple unpacking from self.cabin.
